 "brief": "Several residents sustained wounds Sunday evening after Israeli military vehicles opened fire directly on homes near Al-Mahatta Mosque on Jaffa Street in the Shati neighborhood east of Gaza City, Shehab Wire reported. The shooting struck dwellings in a densely populated residential area.\n\nThe incident occurred as armed clashes and artillery fire continued across scattered locations throughout the Gaza Strip. No additional details were provided on the number of wounded or the extent of damage to the targeted structures.",
